[23.711796, "o", "\r\r\n>>> 3. Files: an ext2 disk on virtio-blk, tmpfs, links, 16 MiB through the page cache\r\r\n\r\r\n  $ grep -E 'ext2|/data' /proc/mounts; ls -l /data\r\r\n"]
